***Oh. Well, it seems that most people who start with Lojban never really want to try any other constructed languages. --((UserPagePlasticRaven|Plastic Raven))

The gismu ((spero)) was suggested for Esperanto, but rejected.

''lei la esperanton prenu.''

'''''shouldn't this be "lei me la esperanton. prenu"?''''' ''If you want a tanru, yes.  But this isn't necessarily a tanru.  __lei la esperanton. prenu__ expands to __lei prenu pe la esperanton__ much as __le mi cukta__ expands to __le cukta pe mi__.''

